Description: This software boasts powerful functions, capable of capturing high-definition images in real time. Its interface is designed for simplicity and clarity, 
 ensuring a user-friendly experience. Kylin-camera combines the core function of photo and video capture, along with additional features such as burst mode，providing 
 users with a versatile and high-quality imaging experience.
